cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
title: >-
  analytic-prophet: Facebook Prophet's fitting engine with a
  hand-derived analytic gradient in place of Stan's automatic
  differentiation
abstract: >-
  A reimplementation of Facebook Prophet's fitting engine that replaces
  Stan with a closed-form gradient derived by hand and a small C++ core.
  It fits the same model -- verified against Stan's own log_prob -- and
  reaches a better optimum by Prophet's own objective at every series
  length measured, because Prophet's optimizer stops short on the
  non-differentiable L1 term that its changepoint prior puts in the
  posterior. Ships with a four-tier evaluation suite: a correctness gate,
  parameter recovery on synthetic series, held-out forecast accuracy on
  36 M4 series, and cost.
type: software
